1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,341
A cracked pot, who thought he was useless…

2
00:00:03,421 --> 00:00:06,530
But he didn't know what wonders his crack was doing.

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,447
In a village, Raghu carried water from the river every day.

4
00:00:09,527 --> 00:00:13,591
He had two pots on his shoulder. One perfect, and one cracked.

5
00:00:13,887 --> 00:00:17,239
By the time he reached home, half the water of the cracked pot was gone.

6
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:19,786
And the perfect pot was very proud of itself.

7
00:00:20,087 --> 00:00:22,040
One day, the cracked pot started crying,

8
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:25,838
Please forgive me. Because of me, your hard work is wasted.

9
00:00:26,153 --> 00:00:27,973
Raghu smiled and said,

10
00:00:28,053 --> 00:00:30,423
Today, on the way back, look at the side of the path.

11
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:34,502
The pot looked. On its side of the path, colourful flowers were blooming.

12
00:00:34,582 --> 00:00:36,567
And on the other side, only dry ground.

13
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:40,925
I knew about your crack. So I sowed seeds on your side.

14
00:00:41,005 --> 00:00:43,035
And every day, you have been watering them.

15
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,113
Lesson.

16
00:00:44,393 --> 00:00:46,782
Your flaw does not make you useless.

17
00:00:47,062 --> 00:00:50,591
Seen the right way, it can become your greatest strength.

18
00:00:51,187 --> 00:00:55,826
If you want to watch stories like this every day and learn something new,

19
00:00:55,906 --> 00:00:59,769
then Like the video, Share it, and Subscribe to the channel.

20
00:00:59,849 --> 00:01:01,467
See you in the next story!
